'''Chroma Traveler's Gun''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2023|2023 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.  

==Appearance==
It takes the design of an ancient revolver but with a Halloween theme to it. Its barrel is chromatic, but fades from red, to magenta, and finally to blue. Tree roots and vines wrap around the barrel. A chromatic Jack-o-lantern takes the place of the cylinder and hammer, and the handle is constructed out of wood with vines wrapped around it.

==Trivia==   
*It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun under the name [[Traveler's Gun]], which can be found in the same box.
*It is the seventh holiday chroma and the fourth Halloween chroma to be released inside the game, the others being [[Chroma Cookiecane]], [[Chroma Elderwood Blade]], [[Chroma Swirly Gun]], [[Chroma Candleflame]], [[Chroma Gingerblade]] and [[Chroma Boneblade]].
*This is the second holiday chroma gun to be released, with the first being [[Chroma Swirly Gun]].
*Chroma Traveler's Gun is the most valuable [[Chroma Weapons|Chroma Weapon]] and one of the rarest items in the game.
*Like all the other Chroma Weapons, it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

